<overview>
<p>Word of Blake Militia infantry served as the backbone of Protectorate garrison forces across dozens of conquered worlds, providing the manpower for territorial control that the Militia's BattleMech and armor assets could not sustain alone. Operating Sniper artillery systems that deliver heavier indirect fire than Thumper tubes, these crews can damage hardened positions and disrupt armored formations at extended range, providing battalion-level fire support from a single crew-served weapon.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Squad/platoon size from TechManual. Armor kit from Tactical Operations. Intro date from official creation of ComStar Guards and Militia (ComGuards).
